{"id":"35129dbe4a036ed2","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Laver Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree — ZFC Tree8 Laver Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree — ZFC Tree8 Laver Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-laver-tree — ZFC Tree8 Laver Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (tree of finite sequences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span> (stem witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span> (node above the stem)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\subseteq t\">\\(u\\subseteq t\\)</span> (initial segment)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (successor coordinate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in V\">\\(H\\in V\\)</span> (finite-sequence carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}laver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(u,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\neq\\varnothing\\land T\\subseteq H\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall u\\in H\\;(u\\subseteq t\\to u\\in T)\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{n\\in\\omega:t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}laver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(u,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\neq\\varnothing\\land T\\subseteq H\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall u\\in H\\;(u\\subseteq t\\to u\\in T)\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{n\\in\\omega:t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Prefix closure is restricted to finite sequences; since successor coordinates lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, non-finiteness gives the required countably infinite splitting.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"u\\subseteq t","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}laver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8LaverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(u,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\neq\\varnothing\\land T\\subseteq H\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall u\\in H\\;(u\\subseteq t\\to u\\in T)\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{n\\in\\omega:t^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\in T\\}))\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1380,"backlinks":[{"id":"0cdd45feac142f0d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","